          <div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number" data-counter="5" data-suffix="K+">0+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Dentures Fitted</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number" data-counter="8" data-suffix="K+">0+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Crowns Delivered</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-images animate-on-scroll">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629909613654-28e377c37b09?w=800&q=80" alt="Modern dental clinic Chennai" class="about-img-main" loading="lazy">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588776814546-1ffcf47267a5?w=600&q=80" alt="Dental treatment in progress" class="about-img-accent" loading="lazy">
          <div class="about-badge">
            <div class="about-badge-number">15+</div>
            <div class="about-badge-text">Years of<br>Excellence</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="animate-on-scroll">
          <span class="section-label">About Our Clinic</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Expert Doctors, Seamless Appointments, Quality Care</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--gray-600);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;">At Dr. Ravi's Dental and Orofacial Pain Clinic, we are committed to delivering exceptional dental care with a personal touch. Led by Dr. Ravi, a seasoned dentist with years of experience in both general and advanced dentistry, our clinic focuses on patient comfort, hygiene, and long-lasting oral health.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--gray-600);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;">We are also Chennai's trusted destination for <strong>orofacial pain management</strong> — treating headaches, migraines, TMJ disorders, and undiagnosed facial pains with advanced diagnostic tools and personalized therapy plans.</p>
          <div class="about-features">
            <div class="about-feature">
              <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div><strong style="color:var(--dark);">Experienced & Gentle Dentist</strong><br><span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-500);">15+ years of clinical practice with thousands of successful treatments</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div><strong style="color:var(--dark);">Modern Equipment & Sterilization</strong><br><span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-500);">Digital X-rays, intra-oral scanners, and strict infection control</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div><strong style="color:var(--dark);">Affordable & Transparent Pricing</strong><br><span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-500);">No hidden costs. Clear treatment plans with flexible options</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-feature">
              <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
              <div><strong style="color:var(--dark);">Emergency Care Available</strong><br><span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-500);">Same-day appointments for dental emergencies and acute pain</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Learn More About Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

